${f}_{Y}(y)$ | $\\frac{7}{27}$ | $\\frac{13}{27}$ | $\\frac{7}{27}$ |\n\nThe conditional probability mass function of $X$ given that $Y=y$ is\n\n$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)=\\frac{f(x,y)}{{f}_{Y}(y)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, dividing each joint probability by the corresponding column total, we obtain the conditional probability mass function of $X$ given that $Y=y:$\n\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)$ | $Y=1$ | $Y=3$ | $Y=9$ |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=1$ | $\\frac{6}{7}$ | $\\frac{10}{13}$ | $\\frac{5}{7}$ |\n| $X=2$ | $\\frac{1}{7}$ | $\\frac{3}{13}$ | $\\frac{2}{7}$ |\n|  | $1$ | $1$ | $1$ |\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X\\,|\\,Y=9] & =[{\\sum }_{x}{x}^{2}\\,{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,9)]-{\\mu }_{X|9}^{2} \\\\  & =[{1}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{5}{7}+{2}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{2}{7}]-{(\\frac{9}{7})}^{2} \\\\  & =\\frac{5}{7}+\\frac{8}{7}-\\frac{81}{49} \\\\  & =\\frac{10}{49}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186511582 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186188328 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92a52324-627c-5796-bc4f-ddeb5380f129" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Conditional Variance Using Column Totals"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "14738cb2-b471-5d99-b3eb-4afbb5fa348a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{1}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510824} {:answer/id #uuid "20ae5337-49f2-5726-8ce9-b5fca604cf7a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{3}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510853} {:answer/id #uuid "518547db-16ad-50af-8a24-b4267aa35a9c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186510957} {:answer/id #uuid "a50bc467-b427-559a-829c-9f60582a46c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186511128} {:answer/id #uuid "ee546c20-c60e-59e8-af15-1c8202fb7fb