is\n\n$$\n{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)=\\frac{f(x,y)}{{f}_{Y}(y)}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, dividing each joint probability by the corresponding column total, we obtain the conditional probability mass function of $X$ given that $Y=y:$\n\n| ${f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,y)$ | $Y=0$ | $Y=2$ |\n| --- | --- | --- |\n| $X=0$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n| $X=1$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ |\n| $X=2$ | $\\frac{1}{2}$ | $\\frac{1}{4}$ |\n|  | $1$ | $1$ |\n\nFinally, we obtain\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\text{Var}[X\\,|\\,Y=2] & =[{\\sum }_{x}{x}^{2}\\,{f}_{X|Y}(x\\,|\\,2)]-{\\mu }_{X|2}^{2} \\\\  & =[{0}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}+{1}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{2}+{2}^{2}\\cdot \\frac{1}{4}]-{1}^{2} \\\\  & =0+\\frac{1}{2}+1-1 \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186188689 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186188328 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92a52324-627c-5796-bc4f-ddeb5380f129" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating a Conditional Variance Using Column Totals"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "984380c5-40cc-5710-a30c-a6c66b2ff180" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{91}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186186415} {:answer/id #uuid "b6b9fba5-d63e-5377-857e-f317e4e33b6d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{103}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186186416} {:answer/id #uuid "d576a0de-cee9-5266-b5b8-30152891dc3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{110}{9}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186186417} {:answer/id #uuid "4cb7bf53-7c58-55f8-abd8-0cd422ffc050" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{70}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186186418} {:answer/id #uuid "7044a4a3-0a43-582f-817a-e99488b07711" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{50}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 1759218618